<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-31T13:46:28.531Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:46:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Pakistani army has destroyed Afghan Taliban posts along the border after mortar and small-arms fire from the Taliban hit northwest Pakistan, killing a civilian and wounding five. The Taliban’s attack also prompted a Pakistani operation against illegal Afghans in Peshawar and a call for international responsibility for Afghan refugees. China and Pakistan opened a green trade channel at the Sost-Khunjerab crossing. The conflict has caused 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE90QUNRYnhYanU0cnpPSmZ6SF9qN3U0VjEwX1BXUVFiZl9BcE5aM3gzeUZPanFlUGQ1a2lQbldsQ2JndXhCa3hpeA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1CMWh1bDJOazBqV3NxaWNSZjNTNG5tNnNrQzFUcVZ4Z1lqaHN2V3E3VXVZd3RUT3B1T3FkVF9mMUhKRHNjQ1paYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE53T0FLRTlXTG1GU2x5TTU3ekNGQ3JxZGxobHB3ZXNySlhiaEpNczBrc3RjRUVrQmNHanF5Vjk2SE1GTTc2NUNkZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBSam1ZZTdlR2JzRUVRU19aa1k4STdMX2FkTDNEaDZFaGpkdGZIaElZbTZSNGlHTS1WblRGdUM4WDJVakNYRGhxRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxObi1mWHRSakNUS3h6ZExQcmVyTkZoX0F4N3lNODNYbE5JV0dxcG9MQ2EtenFUeVUwMGRaYmJ6Z0pRSU5pOUZybHpoOFo4TUtNWjhLMlA1d0ZRcUFwRlpwSktjZ3U0QS1TeFZ5NWJZdmh4Q2I5ZndzUkktLVZqMzNoUlBFdnN6MGpBdy1EMTJiSHlOX1haWVk0MDE2NXhQZWJRZlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channels Television&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Excelsior&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE02OE1xLXkzVWdCY3NBNE1RNWNkdy00eG1mRHhVem9OS19